      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4107,
      "text": "When adversity befalls man, he cries out to Us. Then when We grant him a favor from Us, he says, “I have been granted this only because of my knowledge.” It is rather a test, but most of them do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 464,
      "ruku": 400,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4108,
      "text": "It was already said by those before them[13], but all what they earned was of no avail to them,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 464,
      "ruku": 400,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4109,
      "text": "Therefore the evil consequences of their deeds overtook them, and the wrongdoers among these [pagans] will be overtaken by the evil consequences of their deeds, and they will have no escape[14].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 464,
      "ruku": 400,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4110,
      "text": "Do they not know that Allah extends provision to whom He wills or restricts it? Indeed, there are signs in this for people who believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 464,
      "ruku": 400,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4111,
      "text": "Say [Allah says], “O My slaves who have transgressed against themselves, do not despair of Allah’s mercy, for indeed Allah forgives all sins[15]. He is indeed the All-Forgiving, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 464,
      "ruku": 401,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4112,
      "text": "Turn to your Lord [in repentance] and submit to Him before the punishment comes upon you, for then you will not be helped.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 464,
      "ruku": 401,
      "hizbQuarter": 186,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4113,
      "text": "Follow the best of what has been sent down to you all from your Lord, before the punishment comes upon you by surprise while you are unaware,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
